   "widgets_values": [
    "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] High-end stylized 3D fantasy animation with cinematic lighting. Preserve the exact character designs, castle environment, composition, costumes, treasure chests, pink flowering trees, warm sunlight, and playful proportions established in <Picture 1>. The shot begins at the precise moment shown in the reference image: the tiny fairy finishes a powerful sneeze beside the startled wizard, and the visible comic text \"ACHOO\" lingers briefly before dissolving into sparkling particles. A circular magical gust expands outward, lifting flower petals, leaves, the wizard's robe, the knights' helmet plumes, and the hanging castle banners. The camera pushes in with moderate amplitude toward the sleeping giant at slow speed as his drool swings, nostrils flare, ears twitch, and one eyelid begins to tremble. The knights carrying treasure chests freeze mid-step and slowly turn their helmets toward him. At approximately five seconds, the giant suddenly opens one enormous eye; the camera shakes slightly with the impact as he inhales and raises his head. The camera then pulls out rapidly and trucks backward, following the terrified knights as they run toward the lens, armor bouncing and treasure chests wobbling in their arms. One knight nearly drops his chest while the wizard grabs the fairy and retreats. Behind them, the newly awakened giant leans forward with a confused roar, sending another wave of petals through the sunlit courtyard. End on the knights fleeing chaotically toward the foreground while the giant fills the background, maintaining coherent character anatomy, stable costume details, consistent scale, smooth animation, expressive facial reactions, warm volumetric sunlight, soft cinematic depth of field, and polished feature-film-quality rendering.\n\noverall_soundscape: A soft spring breeze moves through leaves, flower petals, vines, and fabric banners while the giant produces deep rhythmic snores. The fairy releases a sharp high-pitched sneeze followed by a sparkling magical burst; armor rattles, boots pound the path, wooden treasure chests creak, and the knights gasp in panic. The giant's heavy inhale leads into a deep confused roar that shakes the courtyard.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Playful pizzicato strings and light woodwinds at a quick tempo begin quietly beneath the sneaking knights. The music pauses for a fraction of a second at the sneeze, then accelerates with comic percussion, rising brass, and rapid string runs as the giant awakens and the knights flee.",
